Treat B230400 as optional.

The termios speed constants above B115200 are not POSIX. QNX's <termios.h>
stops at B115200, so the case label for 230400 baud has to be conditional.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

--- a/src/ttyopts.c
+++ b/src/ttyopts.c
@@ -176,8 +176,10 @@
         return 57600;
     case B115200:
         return 115200;
+#ifdef B230400
     case B230400:
         return 230400;
+#endif
     }
 }
 
